              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yaremye amahanga yose y’abantu, ibakūye mu muntu umwe, ngo basagaze mw isi yose, yashinze ibihe vy’imyaka ko bikūranwa uko yageze, icira abantu imbibe z’aho baba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
