        },
        {
          "text": "Maze bumvise ivy’ ukuzuka mu bapfuye, bamwe barishinyira, abandi bati Tuzoba turumva ukundi ivy’ utubarira kur’ ivyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
